``` {.python .cell-code}
from sklearn.ensemble import GradientBoostingRegressor

gbrt = GradientBoostingRegressor(
    max_depth=2,
    n_estimators=3,
    learning_rate=1.0,
    random_state=42
)

gbrt.fit(X_gbrt, y_gbrt)
```

