::: {#cell-train-best-gradient-boosting-model .cell execution_count=35}
``` {.python .cell-code}
gbrt_best = GradientBoostingRegressor(
    max_depth=2,
    n_estimators=best_n_estimators,
    random_state=42
)

gbrt_best.fit(X_gbrt_train, y_gbrt_train)
```

